### Central Thesis

Chase Infiniti's celebrated poise is a room-reading skill built on a biracial neighborhood seam in Indianapolis: she converts every pressure into a legible surface, grades herself by whether it reads convincingly in someone else's eye, and cannot credit herself for any of it.

